# Stock Scorecard Project

## Week 3: Stock Classification Using XGBoost

### Project Overview
This project uses the XGBoost machine learning algorithm to classify stock data from a labeled CSV dataset.

### Objective
The objective is to train a classification model using labeled stock data and evaluate its performance on unseen data.

### Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- XGBoost
- Scikit-learn
- Google Colab

### Workflow
1. Load the labeled CSV dataset.
2. Perform data preprocessing.
3. Separate features and target labels.
4. Split the data into training and testing sets.
5. Train the XGBoost classification model.
6. Evaluate the model using suitable classification metrics.

